<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SEMIFINAL RESULTS FROM THE EUROPEAN INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP. [CORRECTED 08:25 GMT 20/10]</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SEMIFINAL RESULTS FROM THE EUROPEAN INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP. [CORRECTED 08:25 GMT 20/10]</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results from the</p>
<p>European indoor championship on Saturday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>4-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 2-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 5-7</p>
<p>6-2 6-2 (Corrects first set score.)</p>
